   "source": [
    "## 17. Team size (inventors) -> disruption percentile & impact (Wu et al. Fig 2a style)\n",
    "\n",
    "Patent analogue of the paper Fig 2a: **team size = number of inventors** (`inventor_list`), **impact =\n",
    "patent->patent citations (`C_5`)**, disruption = percentile of `CD_5`. Small teams should disrupt more,\n",
    "large teams should be cited more. Grant years 1980-2015, `ref_count>=1`, inventors 1-10."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
